%% SC-15: Fork/Remix Skill
%% 流程图: fork-remix-skill.mermaid

flowchart TD
    Start([开始: 用户点击 Fork 按钮]) --> ShowDialog[显示 Fork 对话框]
    ShowDialog --> InputNewName[输入新 Skill 名称]
    InputNewName --> InputNewDesc[输入新描述]
    InputNewDesc --> ShowTargetDir[显示目标目录<br/>~/.claude/skills/]
    ShowTargetDir --> CheckDir{目录是否存在}
    CheckDir -->|存在| ShowExistsError[显示错误<br/>目录已存在，请使用其他名称]
    CheckDir -->|不存在| ConfirmFork[确认创建]

    ShowExistsError --> End([结束])

    ConfirmFork --> ReadSource[读取源 Skill 目录]
    ReadSource --> CopyFiles[复制所有文件]
    CopyFiles --> CreateDir[创建新目录]
    CreateDir --> WriteFiles[写入文件到新目录]
    WriteFiles --> UpdateManifest[更新 SKILL.md<br/>name, description]
    UpdateManifest --> RecordParent[记录 parent_skill_id<br/>追踪来源]
    RecordParent --> SaveDB[保存到数据库]

    SaveDB --> AskEditor{打开编辑器?}
    AskEditor -->|是| LaunchEditor[启动系统编辑器]
    AskEditor -->|否| RefreshList[刷新列表]
    LaunchEditor --> RefreshList

    RefreshList --> ShowNewSkill[显示新的 Fork Skill]
    ShowNewSkill --> ShowSuccess[显示创建成功提示]
    ShowSuccess --> End2([结束: Fork 完成])

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style End fill:#e1f5e1
    style End2 fill:#e1f5e1
    style ShowExistsError fill:#f8d7da
    style ShowSuccess fill:#d1ecf1
